            }
          }
        },
        "summary": "Filters categories by name.\n\nReads the criteria from the request BODY of a GET, which is unusual and\ndeliberate: that is what the Express version did and what the frontend\nsends. Changing it to a query parameter is a breaking change for callers.",
        "tags": [
          "categories"
        ]
      }
    },
